          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After this, Jesus went to Jerusalem for a religious festival. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Near the Sheep Gate in Jerusalem there is a pool",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5.2",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Near the Sheep Gate",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "…",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "a pool",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Near the Sheep Pool… a place.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " with five porches; in Hebrew it is called Bethzatha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5.2",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Bethzatha",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; some manuscripts have",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Bethesda.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A large crowd of sick people were lying in the porches — the blind, the lame, and the paralysed.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5.3",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Some manuscripts add verses 3b–4:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "They were waiting for the water to move,",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "because every now and then an angel of the Lord went down into the pool and stirred up the water. The first sick person to go into the pool after the water was stirred up was healed from whatever disease he had.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A man was there who had been ill for 38 years. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesus saw him lying there, and he knew that the man had been ill for such a long time; so he asked him, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sick man answered, “Sir, I have no one here to put me in the pool when the water is stirred up; while I am trying to get in, somebody else gets there first.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesus said to him, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Immediately the man got well; he picked up his mat and started walking.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The day this happened was a Sabbath, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NEH.13.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Neh 13.19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.17.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jer 17.21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "so the Jewish authorities told the man who had been healed, “This is a Sabbath, and it is against our Law for you to carry your mat.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He answered, “The man who made me well told me to pick up my mat and walk.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They asked him, “Who is the man who told you to do this?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But the man who had been healed did not know who Jesus was, for there was a crowd in that place, and Jesus had slipped away.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Afterwards, Jesus found him in the Temple and said, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the man left and told the Jewish authorities that it was Jesus who had healed him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So they began to persecute Jesus, because he had done this healing on a Sabbath. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesus answered them, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This saying made the Jewish authorities all the more determined to kill him; not only had he broken the Sabbath law, but he had said that God was his own Father and in this way had made himself equal with God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
